# tpm-keyring-unlock: power-button LED
# The system user tpm-keyring-led.service runs as - no login shell, no home,
# no password - and its group of the same name, which may write the LED
# (90-tpm-keyring-led.rules). Installed by install.sh when asked to, removed
# by uninstall.sh, which knows it by the line above.
u tpm-keyring-led - "tpm-keyring-unlock power-button LED" - -
